  <p><font style="margin:0 0 0 0;color:#FFFFFF;font-size:1pt;font-family:Times New Roman;">Revenue Profile for Third Quarter 2025</font></p>
  <hr style="margin-inline-start:auto;margin-inline-end:auto;page-break-after:always;">
  <p align="center"><img style="width: 960px;" src="diod-ex99_2s10.jpg" alt="Slide 10" title="Slide 10"></p>
  <p><font style="margin:0 0 0 0;color:#FFFFFF;font-size:1pt;font-family:Times New Roman;">Quarterly Performance Gross Profit ($ Millions) Revenue ($ Millions) 3Q revenue increased 7% sequentially and 12% year-over-year Growth driven by strong demand in Computing for AI-related server applications as well as data center and edge computing Automotive, Industrial and Consumer also increased sequentially Product mix (from computing and consumer) unfavorably weighed on gross margin in 3Q25 Future margin expansion will be driven by increasing contribution from higher-margin automotive and industrial end markets, new products as well as improved loading across manufacturing facilities.</font></p>
