  <p><font style="margin:0 0 0 0;color:#FFFFFF;font-size:1pt;font-family:Times New Roman;">Balance Sheet ($ in millions) Dec 31, 2023 Dec 31, 2024 Sept 30, 2025 Cash* 329 322 392 Inventory 390 475 471 Current assets 1,187 1,224 1,274 Total assets 2,368 2,386 2,470 Total debt 62 52 58 Total liabilities 558 517 522 Total equity 1,810 1,869 1,947 * Cash and cash equivalents, restricted cash, and short-term investments</font></p>
